'''Matador Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]] increases health and movement speed. [[Talents]] were also added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

