==Trivia==
*In the Spanish translation of [[The Battle Cats]], Matador Cat is female from the start rather than changing gender upon evolution, being named Gata Matadora as opposed to Gato Matador.
*Matador Cat is currently the only [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] whose True Form requires an Epic [[Catfruit]] Seed.
*Bellydance Cat has a typo in her description saying, "Supreme virtuoso of '''an''' vigorous, beautiful dance."

